    },
    "A bubble when Caps Lock turns on or off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "generatesSymbol": false,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A bubble when Caps Lock turns on or off."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Caps Lock 开启或关闭时显示气泡。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Caps Lock のオン・オフでバブルを表示します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A fresh detection would now create more slots than are set up here. Detect Again replaces the current slots and triggers with one slot per installed language.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "generatesSymbol": false,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A fresh detection would now create more slots than are set up here. Detect Again replaces the current slots and triggers with one slot per installed language."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新检测将创建比当前更多的槽位。“再次检测”会替换当前槽位和触发键，为每种已安装的语言创建一个槽位。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今検出すると、現在より多くのスロットが作られます。「再検出」は現在のスロットとトリガーを、インストール済みの言語ごとのスロットに置き換えます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A lone Shift tap is also how many Chinese and Japanese input methods toggle their own modes. CmdIME never picks Shift by itself; keep it only if the two do not clash.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "generatesSymbol": false,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A lone Shift tap is also how many Chinese and Japanese input methods toggle their own modes. CmdIME never picks Shift by itself; keep it only if the two do not clash."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "许多中日文输入法也会用单击 Shift 切换自身模式。CmdIME 不会自动选择 Shift；请仅在两者不冲突时保留此设置。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "多くの中国語・日本語入力メソッドも、Shift 単独のタップでモードを切り替えます。CmdIME が自動で Shift を選ぶことはありません。競合しない場合のみ残してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A slot here is selected every time such an app comes to the front. With App Memory on, only the first time.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "generatesSymbol": false,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A slot here is selected every time such an app comes to the front. With App Memory on, only the first time."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此类应用每次切到前台时都会选中这里的槽位。启用应用记忆时，仅首次选中。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "該当するアプリが前面に来るたびに、このスロットを選択します。アプリの記憶がオンの場合は初回のみです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A slot name cannot be empty.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "generatesSymbol": false,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A slot name cannot be empty."
