    "Move your slots, triggers, indicator themes, imported fonts and activation recipes to another Mac, or keep a copy. An import copies your current settings to a backup folder first.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "generatesSymbol": false,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move your slots, triggers, indicator themes, imported fonts and activation recipes to another Mac, or keep a copy. An import copies your current settings to a backup folder first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将槽位、触发键、指示气泡主题、导入的字体和激活配方迁移到另一台 Mac，或保留副本。导入前会先将当前设置复制到备份文件夹。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "スロット、トリガー、インジケーターテーマ、読み込んだフォント、有効化レシピを別の Mac に移すか、コピーを保存します。読み込み時は、現在の設定を先にバックアップフォルダにコピーします。"
          }
