    "Turn off \"Automatically switch to a document's input source\" in Keyboard settings; it fights this.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "generatesSymbol": false,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn off \"Automatically switch to a document's input source\" in Keyboard settings; it fights this."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在键盘设置中关闭“自动切换到文稿的输入法”，以免冲突。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "競合を避けるため、キーボード設定の「書類ごとに入力ソースを自動的に切り替える」をオフにしてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turned it on and it still reads Missing? macOS sometimes reports a new permission only after the app restarts.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
