    "While Settings is open, CmdIME is in the Dock and the app switcher. After this window closes, it keeps running in the background with no menu bar icon. %@ To stop it, use General > Quit CmdIME.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "generatesSymbol": false,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While Settings is open, CmdIME is in the Dock and the app switcher. After this window closes, it keeps running in the background with no menu bar icon. %@ To stop it, use General > Quit CmdIME."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置窗口打开时，CmdIME 会显示在程序坞和应用切换器中。关闭此窗口后，它会继续在后台运行，不显示菜单栏图标。%@ 要停止运行，请使用“通用 > 退出 CmdIME”。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "設定ウインドウを開いている間、CmdIME は Dock とアプリスイッチャーに表示されます。閉じた後もメニューバーアイコンなしでバックグラウンドで動作します。%@ 停止するには「一般 > CmdIME を終了」を選びます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While Settings is open, CmdIME is in the Dock and the app switcher. After this window closes, it keeps running in the background with no menu bar icon. %@ To stop it, use General > Quit CmdIME. The switch indicator can be customized on the Indicator page.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "generatesSymbol": false,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While Settings is open, CmdIME is in the Dock and the app switcher. After this window closes, it keeps running in the background with no menu bar icon. %@ To stop it, use General > Quit CmdIME. The switch indicator can be customized on the Indicator page."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置窗口打开时，CmdIME 会显示在程序坞和应用切换器中。关闭此窗口后，它会继续在后台运行，不显示菜单栏图标。%@ 要停止运行，请使用“通用 > 退出 CmdIME”。可在“指示气泡”页面自定义切换指示气泡。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "設定ウインドウを開いている間、CmdIME は Dock とアプリスイッチャーに表示されます。閉じた後もメニューバーアイコンなしでバックグラウンドで動作します。%@ 停止するには「一般 > CmdIME を終了」を選びます。切り替えインジケーターは「インジケーター」ページでカスタマイズできます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While this window is open, CmdIME is in the Dock and the app switcher. After it closes, CmdIME keeps running in the background with no menu bar icon. Open CmdIME again to return here.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "generatesSymbol": false,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While this window is open, CmdIME is in the Dock and the app switcher. After it closes, CmdIME keeps running in the background with no menu bar icon. Open CmdIME again to return here."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此窗口打开时，CmdIME 会显示在程序坞和应用切换器中。关闭后，CmdIME 会继续在后台运行，不显示菜单栏图标。再次打开 CmdIME 即可返回此处。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このウインドウが開いている間、CmdIME は Dock とアプリスイッチャーに表示されます。閉じると、メニューバーアイコンなしでバックグラウンド動作を続けます。ここに戻るには CmdIME をもう一度開いてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
