    "macOS asks for two permissions before CmdIME can notice your trigger keys in other apps. CmdIME cannot grant them itself: turn on CmdIME in each list.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "generatesSymbol": false,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS asks for two permissions before CmdIME can notice your trigger keys in other apps. CmdIME cannot grant them itself: turn on CmdIME in each list."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 要求两项权限，CmdIME 才能在其他应用中识别触发键。CmdIME 无法自行授予权限：请在每个列表中开启 CmdIME。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ほかのアプリでトリガーキーを検出するには、macOS の 2 つの権限が必要です。CmdIME 自身では許可できません。それぞれのリストで CmdIME をオンにしてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS will ask for permission the first time there is an update.": {
